1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:05,060
(Sheldon:)It serves the ancient imperative
of protecting oneself against marauders.

2
00:00:08,109 --> 00:00:09,899
- I'll risk it.
- Ooh.

3
00:00:10,069 --> 00:00:11,449
Anything else I should know?

4
00:00:11,613 --> 00:00:15,573
(Sheldon:)Yes. If you use my toothbrush,
I'll jump out that window.

5
00:00:17,076 --> 00:00:19,916
(Sheldon:)Please don't come to my funeral.
Have a good night.

6
00:00:22,457 --> 00:00:24,587
- Sorry about that.
- That's okay.

7
00:00:24,751 --> 00:00:29,131
(Leonard:)FYI, his toothbrush is the red one
in the Plexiglas case under the UV light.

8
00:00:29,297 --> 00:00:32,717
- Ha. Got it.
- Well, sleep tight.

9
00:00:32,884 --> 00:00:34,674
(Penny:)Thanks.

10
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:40,430
Funny expression, sleep tight. Ha-ha. Ha.

11
00:00:41,851 --> 00:00:44,021
(Leonard:)It refers to
the early construction of beds...

12
00:00:44,187 --> 00:00:47,977
(Leonard:)...which featured a mattress suspended
on interlocking ropes, which occasionally...

13
00:00:48,733 --> 00:02:05,043
(Leonard:)Sleep tight.

